            "text": "Consultation Grounded in Advanced EMDR Training",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_C4cfCH": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<p>As a Certified EMDR Therapist and EMDRIA Approved Consultant, Dr. Serravalle provides consultation that supports clinicians in developing stronger EMDR case conceptualization, greater confidence in clinical decision-making, and more thoughtful use of the model in trauma-focused work. Consultation is grounded in both fidelity to the EMDR model and responsiveness to the complexity of real clinical practice.</p><p><strong>While consultation is tailored to the clinician’s experience and goals, the process may include the following:</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "liquid_tcQb8w": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<ul class=\"service-list\">\n  <li><strong>Consultation tailored to your level of experience:</strong> Sessions are shaped around your training, current clinical work, and specific goals for consultation.</li>\n  <li><strong>Case conceptualization support:</strong> Consultation may include discussion of target planning, treatment sequencing, readiness, stabilization, and challenges that arise in the EMDR process.</li>\n  <li><strong>Guidance with stuck points:</strong> Sessions can provide space to think through blocked processing, clinical complexity, pacing, and other areas where additional perspective may be helpful.</li>\n  <li><strong>Integration of protocol and clinical judgment:</strong> Consultation supports both fidelity to the EMDR model and thoughtful decision-making in real clinical practice.</li>\n  <li><strong>Reflective and trauma-informed discussion:</strong> The process is designed to strengthen confidence, deepen understanding, and support more intentional trauma-focused work.</li>\n</ul>"
          }
        }
      },
