            "text": "Our Approach to Therapy",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_YPUUga": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<p>Our approach is relational, clinically grounded, and responsive to the whole person. We understand that symptoms do not exist in isolation. They are often connected to past experiences, current stressors, relationships, nervous system patterns, and the ways people have learned to adapt in order to cope. Therapy is not one-size-fits-all. We work collaboratively to understand what you are carrying, what is getting in the way, and what support will be most effective.</p>"
          }
        }
